<title>USA: Paccar Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Paccar Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BELLEVUE, Wash. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in millions of dollars(a))</p>
<p>						     Three Months Ended</p>
<p>								March 31</p>
<p>							  1997	   1996</p>
<p> Manufacturing and Parts Net Sales     $ 1,443.4    $ 1,027.7</p>
<p> Financial Services Revenues		    68.1	   66.9</p>
<p>Income Before Taxes:</p>
<p> Manufacturing and Parts			  62.9	   32.6</p>
<p> Financial Services				 17.1	   16.7</p>
<p> Investment Income				   5.1	    6.2</p>
<p> Other, net					    3.6	     .3</p>
<p> Total Income Before Income Taxes	     88.7	   55.8</p>
<p> Income Taxes					 30.8	   20.1</p>
<p> Net Income					   57.9	35.7(b)</p>
<p> Net Income Per Share			     1.49	    .92</p>
<p>(a) Except per share amounts.</p>
<p>(b) Includes $11 million of after-tax costs for closure of the Company's Canadian truck plant.</p>
